{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/31_인스타그램_필터/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>cssgram</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://una.github.io/CSSgram/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSSgram</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>index.html</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\">(index.html)\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>head</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>link</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">rel</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>stylesheet<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">href</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/cssgram/0.1.10/cssgram.min.css<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>head</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>나는 cssgram.css 파일을 다운로드하여 /assets/css 폴더에 넣고<br>\nApp.vue CSS 영역에 import 해줬다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(App.vue)\r\n\r\n@import &#39;./assets/css/cssgram.css&#39;;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>인스타그램 필터명을 data로 넣어준 후</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(Container.vue)\r\n\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;compContainer&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      filter: [ &quot;aden&quot;, &quot;_1977&quot;, &quot;brannan&quot;, &quot;brooklyn&quot;, &quot;clarendon&quot;, &quot;earlybird&quot;, &quot;gingham&quot;, &quot;hudson&quot;, \r\n&quot;inkwell&quot;, &quot;kelvin&quot;, &quot;lark&quot;, &quot;lofi&quot;, &quot;maven&quot;, &quot;mayfair&quot;, &quot;moon&quot;, &quot;nashville&quot;, &quot;perpetua&quot;, \r\n&quot;reyes&quot;, &quot;rise&quot;, &quot;slumber&quot;, &quot;stinson&quot;, &quot;toaster&quot;, &quot;valencia&quot;, &quot;walden&quot;, &quot;willow&quot;, &quot;xpro2&quot;],\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n}</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>v-for로 필터 갯수만큼 FilterBox component를 넣어준다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(Container.vue)\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n  &lt;li class=&quot;filter-1&quot; v-for=&quot;(a,i) in filter&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;FilterBox :uploadImage=&quot;uploadImage&quot; :filter=&quot;a&quot;&gt;&lt;/FilterBox&gt;\r\n  &lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>FilterBox.vue</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(FilterBox.vue)\r\n\r\n&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;filter-item&quot; :class=&quot;`${filter}`&quot; :style=&quot;{ backgroundImage : `url(${uploadImage})` }&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt; \r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;compFilterBox&#39;,\r\n  props: {\r\n    uploadImage: String,\r\n    filter: String,\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;style scoped&gt;\r\n.filter-item {display:block; width:10rem; height:10rem; background-size:cover; background-position:center;}\r\n&lt;/style&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"31. 인스타그램 필터 cssgram","summary":"cssgram - [CSSgram](https://una.github.io/CSSgram/) index.html <head> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/cssgram/0.1.10/cssgram.min.css\"> </head> 나는 cssgram.css 파일을 다운로드하여 /assets/css 폴더에 넣고","date":"Jun 26, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/31_인스타그램_필터/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/30_게시글등록/","title":"30. 게시글 등록"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/vue/32_vue3_전역함수/","title":"32. Vue3 global(전역) 함수 사용하기"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}